---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const effective = 'October 16, 2026';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="How CommunitySolarPA.org collects and uses the information you share with us."
>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Effective {effective}</p>

      <p>
        CommunitySolarPA.org ("we," "us") is a Pennsylvania community solar information project.
        This policy explains what information we collect and how we use it.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Information you give us:</strong> when you join our update list, we collect your email address and ZIP code. If you email us, we receive whatever you include in your message.</li>
        <li><strong>Basic site analytics:</strong> we use privacy-friendly analytics to count page views and see general traffic patterns. They don't use advertising cookies or identify you personally.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To send you updates about community solar in Pennsylvania, including when it becomes available in your area.</li>
        <li>To understand which parts of Pennsylvania are most interested, and to tell you about options in your area, using your ZIP code.</li>
        <li>To reply to messages you send us.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we don't do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We don't sell your personal information.</li>
        <li>We don't share your information with solar companies or anyone else for their own marketing. If we ever want to, we'll ask for your permission first.</li>
        <li>We don't call or text you. We collect only your email address for contact.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Service providers</h2>
      <p>
        We use trusted providers to run this site and our email list. They process information only on
        our behalf. Currently, that's MailerLite (email list), Google reCAPTCHA (spam protection on our
        sign-up form), Cloudflare (website hosting and analytics), and Zoho (email).
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Unsubscribe</strong> anytime using the link at the bottom of any email.</li>
        <li><strong>Ask us to see or delete your information</strong> by emailing <a href="mailto:hello@communitysolarpa.org">hello@communitysolarpa.org</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If we change this policy, we'll update the date at the top of this page. Significant changes will also be announced to our email list.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:hello@communitysolarpa.org">hello@communitysolarpa.org</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
